# CORE-0006 — One Python distribution with layered subpackages, inside an Nx workspace

Status: accepted (2026-09-20). The record is canonical: decisions/core/CORE-0006-one-python-distribution.md

Python is a single `jeve` distribution whose subpackages are layered (`contracts → world → decide/memory → gen → sim/api`), with an import-layering test as the boundary, and Nx sees three projects: `py`, `web`, `contracts`.

This decision is immutable. To change it, write a new record and set `superseded-by` on this one — do not edit its substance.
